WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Hi, I'm Vamsi Krishna Kosuri. I'm a PhD candidate in Computer Science

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
at the University of North Texas, advised by Doctor Stephanie Ludi
in the DiscoverABILITY Lab.

00:09.500 --> 00:15.000
I love working at the intersection of AI and human-computer interaction,

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
building programming tools that work for the people they usually leave out —
blind and low-vision programmers, and neurodivergent learners.
